{
  "id": "amazon_robots",
  "lang": "en",
  "title": "Amazon's robots bring the *shelves* to you 🤖",
  "pronounce": {},
  "aspect": "1:1",
  "gap": 0.05,
  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "In Amazon's warehouses,",
      "the *shelves* drive to you."
    ],
    "clip": "a_pod",
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": 0,
        "x": 0.45,
        "y": 0.62,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:shelves"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "These orange robots",
        "slide under a shelf…"
      ],
      "clip": "a_close"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…lift the *whole thing*,",
        "and carry it to a worker."
      ],
      "clip": "a_lift",
      "punch": true
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "No walking the aisles.",
        "The item comes to *you*."
      ],
      "clip": "a_aisle",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "ding",
          "at": "word:you"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Amazon bought the startup behind them,",
        "*Kiva Systems*, in 2012…"
      ],
      "clip": "a_kiva"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…for *$775 million*."
      ],
      "clip": "a_swarm",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "wow",
          "at": "end",
          "gain": -4
        }
      ],
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Today it runs over *one million* robots,"
      ],
      "clip": "a_line"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "and some roam freely",
        "right next to people."
      ],
      "clip": "a_proteus"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "clip": "a_proteus_close",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Kiva used to sell these robots",
        "to *other* retailers."
      ],
      "clip": "a_pods"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "After the deal,",
        "Amazon *stopped* selling them."
      ],
      "clip": "card_kiva",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:stopped"
        }
      ],
      "annotate": [
        {
          "type": "stamp",
          "at": "word:stopped+0.2",
          "text": "AMAZON ONLY",
          "x": 0.66,
          "y": 0.13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Rivals scrambled to build their own —",
        "a *robot arms race*."
      ],
      "clip": "a_rival"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Now Amazon may soon have",
        "as many *robots* as *people*."
      ],
      "clip": "a_carts",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "gasp",
          "at": "end"
        }
      ],
      "pause_after": 0.4
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Would *you* work next to one?"
      ],
      "clip": "a_walk"
    }
  ],
